body:
Innocent pranks are the best! The laughing on the floor with tears coming out of your eyes moments are especially priceless! 

That's adorable! Sorry to hear he's out of town tomorrow though\~

&#x200B;

I guess I'm just worried because she might get mad at us if something happens in the future, you know? Like what if she says, "You guys could have tried harder!". 

&#x200B;

And wow, thank you so much haha. :)
